#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""The checked regression journeys, their generated operator reference, and
the ledger for one unattended run.

The prose remains prose because an LLM driver judges it at run time. This
module gives that prose stable structure, checks every cross-reference, and
keeps the committed reference byte-equal to deterministic regeneration. The
run ledger records outcomes only; it does not pretend to execute or judge a
journey.
"""

